    "user_message": {
      "text": "Gave the \"no-dig\" thing a proper go for two seasons and honestly I think it's overrated nonsense for anyone with real weeds. Bindweed came straight through the cardboard like it was tissue paper. Maybe it's lovely on a pristine allotment, but on my clay it's just an expensive way to feed the slugs."
    }
